From a03c37d7c725376c23c6ffac2e9c01751f9ac53c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 06:40:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] generic-parallel: tests of material properties using data or
 other material laws

- LinearDataInterpolationTest: material property defined by the linear
  interpolation of data, with quantities.
- MaterialLawCallTest: material property calling another material
  property (Inconel600_YoungModulus).

Both are generated and checked by all the configurations. The checks are
shared by a checkTemperatureDependentMaterialProperty function in each
test program.

test-hip.hip: hipMallocManaged takes a size in bytes, not a number of
values.
